#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:396
msgid ""
"**Cookie:** The ``CookieInterface::SAMESITE_STRICT``, "
"``CookieInterface::SAMESITE_LAX``, and ``CookieInterface::SAMESITE_NONE``"
" constants are now written in ucfirst style to be consistent with usage "
"in the rest of the framework."
